  "description": "Why We Love It\nThe Amiti-E+ is a versatile new E-bike from Liv that lets you explore gravel paths as well as open roads. Its wider tires add extra comfort and stability on any surface, and make the Amiti-E+ the perfect bike to get you rolling and exploring new terrain.\n\nThree levels of speed control: Eco, Normal or Sport, adding 80%, 180% or 300% pedal assistance\n\nFront suspension to smooth out terrain, lock-out on select models\n\nInternal cable routing for sleek outlook and decreased wear and tear\n\nIntegrated dropouts make adding accessories easy\n\nDisc brakes for precise braking and control in all terrain and variable weather conditions\n\nHandlebar-mounted riding mode control\n\nIntegrated lights on headtube, fenders, tires for optimal comfort and safety\n\nLow standover height for increased confidence. Select frames are step-through for easy mounting and dismounting\n\nLightweight and durable ALUXX SL -grade aluminum frame\n\nDesigned using Liv’s 3F Design Philosophy to build bikes for women\n\nLivRight Sizing Philosophy for the perfect fit across all sizes",
